First, thank you all for participating, and for being so patient with us in our
efforts to re-construct the tournament system this year.

I'm going to have to take most of December away from thinking about this, but
in January I'd like to start re-designing the Clan trophy(ies) to better
reflect how y'all value diferent achievements on the scoreboard.

We will also start testing dgamelaunch then and, if it works out we'll start
re-writing the game server kit.

Now that marvin has accomplished a full score on Best of 13, we're also open o
suggestions on a new Grand prize trophy (though we'd keep Best of 13 as well),
in case he starts feeling it's not challenging enough.  ;-)

